#: ../../../Users/huchang/zett-agent/docs/index.rst:-1
msgid "Agents that forge the tools they need. A small Python runtime for tool-calling agents, with a JIT harness that lets a model write, reuse, and inspect its own tools in the middle of a run."
msgstr "能自己锻造所需工具的智能体。一个用于工具调用智能体的小型 Python 运行时，内置 JIT harness，让模型在一次运行途中编写、复用和检查自己的工具。"

#: ../../../Users/huchang/zett-agent/docs/index.rst:9
#: ../../../Users/huchang/zett-agent/docs/index.rst:17
msgid "Zett Agent"
msgstr "Zett Agent"

#: ../../../Users/huchang/zett-agent/docs/index.rst:25
msgid ":doc:`Meet the JIT harness → <learn/jit-harness>`"
msgstr ":doc:`认识 JIT harness → <learn/jit-harness>`"

#: ../../../Users/huchang/zett-agent/docs/index.rst:29
msgid "Agents that forge **the tools they need.**"
msgstr "能自己锻造\\ **所需工具**\\ 的智能体。"

#: ../../../Users/huchang/zett-agent/docs/index.rst:31
msgid "Zett Agent is a small Python runtime for tool-calling agents. Its JIT harness lets a model write and reuse its own tools in the middle of a run, so a long task stops paying for the same exploration twice."
msgstr "Zett Agent 是一个用于工具调用智能体的小型 Python 运行时。它的 JIT harness 让模型在一次运行途中编写并复用自己的工具，因此长任务不必为同样的探索反复付出代价。"

#: ../../../Users/huchang/zett-agent/docs/index.rst:36
msgid "Bring your own model and ordinary Python functions. Add skills, persistence, and delegation when you need them."
msgstr "带上你自己的模型和普通的 Python 函数。需要时再添加技能、持久化和委派。"

#: ../../../Users/huchang/zett-agent/docs/index.rst:41
msgid ":doc:`Build your first agent → <learn/first-agent>`"
msgstr ":doc:`构建你的第一个智能体 → <learn/first-agent>`"

#: ../../../Users/huchang/zett-agent/docs/index.rst:43
msgid ":doc:`Meet the JIT harness <learn/jit-harness>`"
msgstr ":doc:`认识 JIT harness <learn/jit-harness>`"

#: ../../../Users/huchang/zett-agent/docs/index.rst:47
msgid "Python 3.10+"
msgstr "Python 3.10+"

