msgstr "`MIT 许可证 <https://github.com/Chang-LeHung/zett-agent/blob/main/LICENSE>`__"

#: ../../../Users/huchang/zett-agent/docs/index.rst:49
msgid "`Available on PyPI ↗ <https://pypi.org/project/zett-agent/>`__"
msgstr "`PyPI 上可用 ↗ <https://pypi.org/project/zett-agent/>`__"

#: ../../../Users/huchang/zett-agent/docs/index.rst:55
msgid "Your application"
msgstr "你的应用"

#: ../../../Users/huchang/zett-agent/docs/index.rst:56
#: ../../../Users/huchang/zett-agent/docs/index.rst:77
msgid "Python"
msgstr "Python"

#: ../../../Users/huchang/zett-agent/docs/index.rst:76
msgid "Written by the model, mid-run"
msgstr "由模型在运行途中编写"

#: ../../../Users/huchang/zett-agent/docs/index.rst:90
msgid "Use a configured model inside an async function. Start with :doc:`the complete, no-key example <learn/first-agent>`. Generated tools are trusted code, not a sandbox: :doc:`read the JIT harness guide <learn/jit-harness>`."
msgstr "在异步函数中使用已配置好的模型。可以先看\\ :doc:`完整且无需密钥的示例 <learn/first-agent>`\\ 。生成出来的工具是受信任的代码，而不是沙箱：请阅读\\ :doc:`JIT harness 指南 <learn/jit-harness>`\\ 。"

#: ../../../Users/huchang/zett-agent/docs/index.rst
msgid "pip"
msgstr "pip"

#: ../../../Users/huchang/zett-agent/docs/index.rst
msgid "uv"
msgstr "uv"

#: ../../../Users/huchang/zett-agent/docs/index.rst:112
msgid "Let the model forge what it needs"
msgstr "让模型锻造它需要的东西"

#: ../../../Users/huchang/zett-agent/docs/index.rst:114
msgid "JIT here means building the tool environment when a task needs it, not a Python just-in-time compiler. The harness works through ordinary function calling, so it runs on Responses and Chat Completions alike."
msgstr "这里的 JIT 指的是在任务需要时构建工具环境，而不是 Python 的即时编译器。JIT harness 通过普通的函数调用来工作，因此在 Responses 和 Chat Completions 上都能运行。"

#: ../../../Users/huchang/zett-agent/docs/index.rst:122
msgid "**Forge**"
msgstr "**锻造**"

#: ../../../Users/huchang/zett-agent/docs/index.rst:124
msgid "The model writes a Python tool or a Markdown procedure into its repository on disk, and ``repo_load`` registers it. A tool can span several files that import each other."
msgstr "模型把 Python 工具或 Markdown 过程写进自己磁盘上的仓库，再由 ``repo_load`` 注册它。一个工具可以横跨多个相互导入的文件。"

#: ../../../Users/huchang/zett-agent/docs/index.rst:130
msgid "**Reuse and compose**"
msgstr "**复用与组合**"

#: ../../../Users/huchang/zett-agent/docs/index.rst:132
msgid "Tools call each other through ``harness.call_tool``. One outer call can drive a loop of nested calls whose results never enter the context."
msgstr "工具之间通过 ``harness.call_tool`` 相互调用。一次外层调用可以驱动一串嵌套调用，而这些调用的结果从不进入上下文。"

#: ../../../Users/huchang/zett-agent/docs/index.rst:137
msgid "**Keep and unload**"
msgstr "**保留与卸载**"

#: ../../../Users/huchang/zett-agent/docs/index.rst:139
msgid "The repository is ordinary files, so the next session finds its tools again, with its notes listed. Unload what the task no longer needs; the model reads how its tools do through ``profile_tools``, and your application can read all of it."
msgstr "仓库就是普通文件，所以下一个会话还能找到自己的工具，并列出它的笔记。卸载任务不再需要的内容；模型通过 ``profile_tools``\\ 查看自己工具的表现，你的应用则可以读取全部数据。"

#: ../../../Users/huchang/zett-agent/docs/index.rst:144
msgid ":doc:`Read the JIT harness guide <learn/jit-harness>` for the four tools the model sees, loading, and the trust boundary."
msgstr ":doc:`阅读 JIT harness 指南 <learn/jit-harness>`，了解模型看到的四个工具、加载方式以及信任边界。"

#: ../../../Users/huchang/zett-agent/docs/index.rst:148
msgid "Everything you need. Only when you need it."
msgstr "需要的一切，只在需要时出现。"

#: ../../../Users/huchang/zett-agent/docs/index.rst:150
msgid "Keep the first agent simple. Add capabilities without changing how you run it."
msgstr "让第一个智能体保持简单。添加能力，但不改变运行方式。"

#: ../../../Users/huchang/zett-agent/docs/index.rst:155
msgid "Bring your model"
msgstr "接入你的模型"

#: ../../../Users/huchang/zett-agent/docs/index.rst:159
msgid "OpenAI, Anthropic, Google, DeepSeek, or Ollama. Use the same client, tools, and event callbacks with every built-in adapter."
msgstr "OpenAI、Anthropic、Google、DeepSeek 或 Ollama。每个内置适配器都使用同一套客户端、工具和事件回调。"

#: ../../../Users/huchang/zett-agent/docs/index.rst:162
msgid "Turn functions into tools"
msgstr "把函数变成工具"

#: ../../../Users/huchang/zett-agent/docs/index.rst:166
msgid "Write a typed Python function. Its signature and docstring become the tool definition; the runtime validates and executes calls."
msgstr "编写一个带类型注解的 Python 函数。它的签名和文档字符串成为工具定义；运行时负责校验并执行调用。"

#: ../../../Users/huchang/zett-agent/docs/index.rst:169
msgid "Stream the whole conversation"
msgstr "流式输出整段对话"

#: ../../../Users/huchang/zett-agent/docs/index.rst:173
msgid "Show incremental text, reasoning when available, tool progress, and results. Connect your own terminal, UI, or service."
msgstr "展示增量文本、可用的推理内容、工具进度和结果。接入你自己的终端、UI 或服务。"

#: ../../../Users/huchang/zett-agent/docs/index.rst:176
msgid "Load capabilities on demand"
msgstr "按需加载能力"

#: ../../../Users/huchang/zett-agent/docs/index.rst:180
msgid "Keep skills in editable text files. Discover their instructions as needed, or search deferred tools on supported Responses endpoints."
msgstr "把技能保存在可编辑的文本文件中。需要时再发现它们的指令，或者在支持的 Responses 端点上搜索延迟加载的工具。"

#: ../../../Users/huchang/zett-agent/docs/index.rst:184
msgid "Start here. Go further."
msgstr "从这里开始，走得更远。"

#: ../../../Users/huchang/zett-agent/docs/index.rst:186
msgid "Follow a tutorial, find a complete example, or look up an exact interface."
msgstr "跟着教程做一遍，找一个完整示例，或者查阅某个确切的接口。"

#: ../../../Users/huchang/zett-agent/docs/index.rst:192
msgid "**01 / Get started**"
msgstr "**01 / 快速开始**"

#: ../../../Users/huchang/zett-agent/docs/index.rst:194
msgid ":doc:`Run your first agent <learn/first-agent>` without an API key. Then connect a provider, add tools, and stream a real answer."
msgstr ":doc:`运行你的第一个智能体 <learn/first-agent>`，无需 API 密钥。然后接入模型提供商、添加工具，并流式输出真实的回答。"

#: ../../../Users/huchang/zett-agent/docs/index.rst:199
msgid "**02 / Find working code**"
msgstr "**02 / 找到可运行的代码**"

#: ../../../Users/huchang/zett-agent/docs/index.rst:201
msgid ":doc:`Browse complete examples <examples/index>` for sessions, approvals, context compaction, delegation, and cancellation."
msgstr ":doc:`浏览完整示例 <examples/index>`，了解会话、审批、上下文压缩、委派和取消。"

#: ../../../Users/huchang/zett-agent/docs/index.rst:206
msgid "**03 / Make it yours**"
msgstr "**03 / 打造成你自己的**"

#: ../../../Users/huchang/zett-agent/docs/index.rst:208
msgid ":doc:`Build an extension <extending/first-extension>` for your workflow. Learn how to add tools, instructions, and progress events."
msgstr ":doc:`为你的工作流构建扩展 <extending/first-extension>`\\ 。了解如何添加工具、指令和进度事件。"

#: ../../../Users/huchang/zett-agent/docs/index.rst:213
msgid "**04 / Look it up**"
msgstr "**04 / 查阅接口**"

#: ../../../Users/huchang/zett-agent/docs/index.rst:215
msgid ":doc:`Explore the API reference <reference/index>` for signatures, defaults, configuration fields, and examples."
msgstr ":doc:`浏览 API 参考 <reference/index>`，查找签名、默认值、配置字段和示例。"

#: ../../../Users/huchang/zett-agent/docs/index.rst:218
msgid "Already building an application? Start with :doc:`learn/configuration` for defaults and request overrides, :doc:`learn/application` for timeouts and concurrent conversations, and :doc:`learn/testing` for deterministic tests."
msgstr "已经在开发应用了？可以从\\ :doc:`learn/configuration`\\ 入手了解默认值和请求级覆盖，用\\ :doc:`learn/application`\\ 了解超时和并发对话，用\\ :doc:`learn/testing`\\ 编写确定性的测试。"

#: ../../../Users/huchang/zett-agent/docs/index.rst:223
msgid "A simple loop, from question to answer"
msgstr "从问题到答案的简单循环"

#: ../../../Users/huchang/zett-agent/docs/index.rst:225
msgid "The model can answer immediately or ask for tools. Zett Agent runs those tools, returns their results, and calls the model again until it answers."
msgstr "模型可以直接作答，也可以请求工具。Zett Agent 运行这些工具，返回工具结果，然后再次调用模型，直到它给出答案。"

#: ../../../Users/huchang/zett-agent/docs/index.rst:230
msgid "Your message"
msgstr "你的消息"

#: ../../../Users/huchang/zett-agent/docs/index.rst:231
#: ../../../Users/huchang/zett-agent/docs/index.rst:233
msgid "Model"
msgstr "模型"

#: ../../../Users/huchang/zett-agent/docs/index.rst:232
msgid "Tools, if needed"
msgstr "工具（如需要）"

#: ../../../Users/huchang/zett-agent/docs/index.rst:234
msgid "Answer"
msgstr "答案"

#: ../../../Users/huchang/zett-agent/docs/index.rst:236
msgid "History, approvals, and context management extend that same loop. You choose what to enable; your application keeps control of its UI and resources. See :doc:`how it works <concepts/architecture>` when you want the mental model."
msgstr "历史记录、审批和上下文管理都是在这同一个循环上扩展出来的。启用哪些由你决定，你的应用始终掌控自己的 UI 和资源。想建立整体认知时，可以看\\ :doc:`工作原理 <concepts/architecture>`\\ 。"

